      ],
      "source": "https://relocatenewtok.org/mertarvik/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In October 2019, roughly one‑third of Newtok residents moved across the river to Mertarvik, bringing dogs, suitcases, and household appliances.",
